{"title":"The Quiet Rows","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Bandits have been skimming the north orchard for three weeks, never enough to bring the constable, always enough to notice. Jack Appleseed wants it answered with steel.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/jack-appleseed\">Jack Appleseed</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"jack-appleseed\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p>Nothing to bring.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/jack-appleseed\">Jack Appleseed</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Havenheim)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"jack-appleseed\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kill 12 bandits in Longmeadow Plains <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Report back to Jack Appleseed <span class=\"muted\">at 450, 161</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"450|161|Report back to Jack Appleseed\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>240</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>10,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Quiet Rows</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-quiet-rows\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-quiet-rows\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-quiet-rows\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-quiet-rows\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}